sec.p:
In this paper, we focus on improving the prediction accuracy of AMPs and non-AMPs by leveraging the spatial structural information of peptides. We first predict the 3D structures of peptides based on their amino acid sequences using Omegafold [38] and construct peptide graphs from the C\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
